   Duy Thinh Do, Hokkaido Univ, Grad Sch Engn, Sapporo, Hokkaido 0608628, Japan.
   Mori, Suguru; Nomura, Rie, Hokkaido Univ, Fac Engn, Sapporo, Hokkaido 0608628, Japan.},
