   residents visiting GI facilities for recreation/relaxation (male=24.7\%,
   female=24.1\%) activities in Lagos Metropolis. The study suggests among
   others that, the Lagos State government should develop GI facilities to
   enhance more opportunity for job generation, while more public
   orientation on positive attitude toward use of GI facilities should be
   emphasized.},
